			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "MOD : Literal Sky Block (@literalskyblock)"
			description: [
				"&7The Grand Mall featured sky lights and open areas that could see outside. It helped the feeling of the mall being an actual place."
				""
				"&7These were done with Sky Blocks, which gave the illusion of distance, clouds, day and night."
				""
				"&7But once the Grand Mall became the Liminal Mall, the open sky became...a little more unsettling."
