		{
			title: "Vending Anything and Everything"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 0.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "MOD : Vending Machine (@vm)"
			description: [
				"&7Vending Machines are scattered all around the Liminal Mall. And since the Mall was disconnected from the rest of the game, the code for them has gone a little...buggy."
				""
				"&7The stock of the vendine machines can be a little odd. You'll need to find Liminal Coins to purchase things from them."
				""
				"&7You can find things like Budding Crystals for Raw Vaults in them, interstingly enough."
			]
